  "Title": "ELSA-2026-47083:  pipewire security update (IMPORTANT)",
  "Description": "[1.4.11-1]\n- Rebase to 1.4.11\n- Add fixes for CVE-2026-5674\n  Resolves: RHEL-164823\n\n[1.4-6-1]\n- Update version to 1.4.6\n  Resolves: DESKTOP-1857\n\n[1.2.7-1]\n- Update version to 1.2.7\n- Resolves: RHEL-76017\n\n[1.2.6-3]\n- Enable libcamera support in RHEL-10\n- Resolves: RHEL-64753\n\n[1.2.6-2]\n- Bump release for October 2024 mass rebuild:\n  Resolves: RHEL-64018\n\n[1.2.6-1]\n- Update version to 1.2.6\n\n[1.2.3-1]\n- Update version to 1.2.3\n\n[1.2.1-3]\n- pipewire-jack-libs Requires pipewire-jack on RHEL\n\n[1.2.1-2]\n- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_41_Mass_Rebuild\n\n[1.2.1-1]\n- Update version to 1.2.1",
